 {
  "id": "asp-0337",
  "level": "g4",
  "title": {
   "nl": "Kinderen van was",
   "en": "Children of wax"
  },
  "cover": {},
  "coverImage": "books/0337/cover.jpg",
  "online": {
   "sourceTitle": "Children of wax",
   "sourceUrl": "https://africanstorybook.org/reader.php?id=2181",
   "licence": "Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 International License",
   "licenceUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/",
   "author": "Southern African Folktale",
   "illustrator": "Wiehan de Jager",
   "translator": "Thomas Depoortere",
   "readerUrl": "https://global-asp.github.io/storybooks-swahili/stories/nl/0337/"
  },
  "pages": [
   {
    "nl": "Er was eens een gelukkig gezin.",
    "en": "Once upon a time, there lived a happy family.",
    "image": "books/0337/01.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Ze vochten nooit met elkaar. Ze hielpen hun ouders thuis en op het veld.",
    "en": "They never fought with each other. They helped their parents at home and in the fields.",
    "image": "books/0337/02.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Maar ze mochten niet in de buurt van vuur komen.",
    "en": "But they were not allowed to go near a fire.",
    "image": "books/0337/03.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Ze moesten all hun werk ‘s nachts doen. Want ze waren gemaakt van was!",
    "en": "They had to do all their work during the night. Because they were made of wax!",
    "image": "books/0337/04.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Maar één van de jongens wilde naar buiten in het zonlicht.",
    "en": "But one of the boys longed to go out in the sunlight.",
    "image": "books/0337/05.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Op een dag was het verlangen te sterk. Zijn broers waarschuwden hem…",
    "en": "One day the longing was too strong. His brothers warned him…",
    "image": "books/0337/06.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Maar het was te laat! Hij smolt in de hete zon.",
    "en": "But it was too late! He melted in the hot sun.",
    "image": "books/0337/07.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "De wassen kinderen waren zo verdrietig toen ze hun broer zagen wegsmelten.",
    "en": "The wax children were so sad to see their brother melting away.",
    "image": "books/0337/08.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Maar ze hadden een plan. Ze boetseerden de gesmolten was in de vorm van een vogel.",
    "en": "But they made a plan. They shaped the lump of melted wax into a bird.",
    "image": "books/0337/09.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Ze namen hun vogelbroer mee naar een hoge berg.",
    "en": "They took their bird brother up to a high mountain.",
    "image": "books/0337/10.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "En toen de zon opkwam vloog hij zingend het morgenlicht in.",
    "en": "And as the sun rose, he flew away singing into the morning light.",
    "image": "books/0337/11.jpg"
   }
  ],
  "avi": "AVI M4",
  "shelf": "eerste",
  "colour": "#e8862f"
 },
 {
  "id": "asp-0210",
  "level": "g4",
  "title": {
   "nl": "Ting-gi en de koeien",
   "en": "Tingi and the cows"
  },
  "cover": {},
  "coverImage": "books/0210/cover.jpg",
  "online": {
   "sourceTitle": "Tingi and the Cows",
   "sourceUrl": "https://africanstorybook.org/reader.php?id=7441",
   "licence": "Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 International License",
   "licenceUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/",
   "author": "Ingrid Schechter",
   "illustrator": "Ingrid Schechter",
   "translator": "Esther Beugeling-Ford",
   "readerUrl": "https://global-asp.github.io/storybooks-swahili/stories/nl/0210/"
  },
  "pages": [
   {
    "nl": "Ting-gi leefde met zijn grootmoeder.",
    "en": "Tingi lived with his grandmother.",
    "image": "books/0210/01.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Vroeger zorgde hij samen met haar voor de koeien.",
    "en": "He used to look after the cows with her.",
    "image": "books/0210/02.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Op een dag kwamen de soldaten.",
    "en": "One day the soldiers came.",
    "image": "books/0210/03.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Ze haalden de koeien weg.",
    "en": "They took the cows away.",
    "image": "books/0210/04.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Ting-gi en zijn grootmoeder renden weg en verstopten zich.",
    "en": "Tingi and his grandmother ran away and hid.",
    "image": "books/0210/05.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Ze verstopten zich in de bush tot het avond was.",
    "en": "They hid in the bush until night.",
    "image": "books/0210/06.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Toen kwamen de soldaten terug.",
    "en": "Then the soldiers came back.",
    "image": "books/0210/07.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Grootmoeder verstopte Ting-gi onder de bladeren.",
    "en": "Grandmother hid Tingi under the leaves.",
    "image": "books/0210/08.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Een van de soldaten stond met zijn voet bovenop hem, maar hij hield zich stil.",
    "en": "One of the soldiers put his foot right on him, but he kept quiet.",
    "image": "books/0210/09.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Toen het veilig was, kwamen Ting-gi en zijn grootmoeder tevoorschijn.",
    "en": "When it was safe, Tingi and his grandmother came out.",
    "image": "books/0210/10.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Ze slopen heel zachtjes naar huis.",
    "en": "They crept home very quietly.",
    "image": "books/0210/11.jpg"
   }
  ],
  "avi": "AVI M4",
  "shelf": "eerste",
  "colour": "#e8574f"
 },
 {
  "id": "asp-0342",
  "level": "g4",
  "title": {
   "nl": "Straf",
   "en": "Punishment"
  },
  "cover": {},
  "coverImage": "books/0342/cover.jpg",
  "online": {
   "sourceTitle": "Punishment",
   "sourceUrl": "https://africanstorybook.org/reader.php?id=11989",
   "licence": "Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 International License",
   "licenceUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/",
   "author": "Adelheid Marie Bwire",
   "illustrator": "Melany Pietersen",
   "translator": "Sacha Kalseth",
   "readerUrl": "https://global-asp.github.io/storybooks-swahili/stories/nl/0342/"
  },
  "pages": [
   {
    "nl": "Op een dag kreeg mama veel fruit.",
    "en": "One day, mama got a lot of fruit.",
    "image": "books/0342/01.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Wij vragen “Wanneer mogen wij wat fruit krijgen?” “We gaan het fruit vanavond eten”, antwoorde mama.",
    "en": "“When can we have some fruit?” we ask. “We will have the fruit tonight,” says mama.",
    "image": "books/0342/02.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Mijn broer Rahim is gulzig. Hij proeft al het fruit. Hij eet er veel van.",
    "en": "My brother Rahim is greedy. He tastes all the fruit. He eats a lot of it.",
    "image": "books/0342/03.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "“Kijk wat Rahim heeft gedaan!” schreeuwt mijn broertje. “Rahim is stout en egoïstisch”, zeg ik.",
    "en": "“Look at what Rahim did!” shouts my little brother. “Rahim is naughty and selfish,” I say.",
    "image": "books/0342/04.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Moeder is boos op Rahim.",
    "en": "Mother is angry with Rahim.",
    "image": "books/0342/05.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Wij zijn ook boos op Rahim. Maar Rahim heeft geen spijt.",
    "en": "We are also angry with Rahim. But Rahim is not sorry.",
    "image": "books/0342/06.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "“Ga je Rahim geen straf geven?” vraagt mijn broertje.",
    "en": "“Aren’t you going to punish Rahim?” asks little brother.",
    "image": "books/0342/07.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "“Rahim, je zult er snel spijt van hebben”, waarschuwt mama.",
    "en": "“Rahim, soon you will be sorry,” warns mama.",
    "image": "books/0342/08.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Rahim begint zich misselijk te voelen.",
    "en": "Rahim starts to feel sick.",
    "image": "books/0342/09.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "“Ik heb zo een pijn in mijn buik”, fluisterd Rahim.",
    "en": "“My tummy is so sore,” whispers Rahim.",
    "image": "books/0342/10.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Mama wist dat dit zou gebeuren. De fruit geeft Rahim straf!",
    "en": "Mama knew this would happen. The fruit is punishing Rahim!",
    "image": "books/0342/11.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Rahim heeft later spijt. “Ik zal nooit meer zo gulzig zijn”, belooft hij. En we geloven hem allemaal.",
    "en": "Later, Rahim says sorry to us. “I will never be so greedy again,” he promises. And we all believe him.",
    "image": "books/0342/12.jpg"
   }
  ],
  "avi": "AVI M4",
  "shelf": "eerste",
  "colour": "#ff7a1a"
 },
 {
  "id": "asp-0001",
