 {
  "id": "asp-0095",
  "level": "g4",
  "title": {
   "nl": "Zama is geweldig!",
   "en": "Zama is great!"
  },
  "cover": {},
  "coverImage": "books/0095/cover.jpg",
  "online": {
   "sourceTitle": "Zama is great!",
   "sourceUrl": "https://africanstorybook.org/reader.php?id=9984",
   "licence": "Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 International License",
   "licenceUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/",
   "author": "Michael Oguttu",
   "illustrator": "Vusi Malindi",
   "translator": "Esther Beugeling-Ford",
   "readerUrl": "https://global-asp.github.io/storybooks-swahili/stories/nl/0095/"
  },
  "pages": [
   {
    "nl": "Mijn broertje ligt nog te slapen. Ik ben vroeg wakker want ik ben geweldig!",
    "en": "My little brother sleeps very late. I wake early, because I am great!",
    "image": "books/0095/01.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Ik ben degene die de zon naar binnen laat schijnen.",
    "en": "I am the one who lets in the sun.",
    "image": "books/0095/02.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "“Jij bent mijn ochtendster,” zegt mamma.",
    "en": "“You’re my morning star,” says Ma.",
    "image": "books/0095/03.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Ik was mezelf, daar heb ik geen hulp bij nodig.",
    "en": "I wash myself, I don’t need any help.",
    "image": "books/0095/04.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Ik kan met koud water en blauwe stinkzeep overweg.",
    "en": "I can cope with cold water and blue smelly soap.",
    "image": "books/0095/05.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Mamma zegt, “Vergeet je tanden niet te poetsen.” En ik antwoord, “Nee, dat vergeet ik nooit!”",
    "en": "Ma reminds, “Don’t forget teeth.” I reply, “Never, not me!”",
    "image": "books/0095/06.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Na me gewassen te hebben, groet ik opa and tante en wens ik hen een fijne dag.",
    "en": "After washing, I greet Grandpa and Auntie, and wish them a good day.",
    "image": "books/0095/07.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Daarna kleed ik mezelf aan. “Ik ben al groot, mamma,” zeg ik.",
    "en": "Then I dress myself, “I’m big now Ma,” I say.",
    "image": "books/0095/08.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Ik kan mijn jurk dichtknopen en de gespen van mijn schoenen vastmaken.",
    "en": "I can close my buttons and buckle my shoes.",
    "image": "books/0095/09.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "En ik vertel mijn kleine broertje al het schoolnieuws.",
    "en": "And I make sure little brother knows all the school news.",
    "image": "books/0095/10.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "In de klas doe ik op allerlei manieren mijn best.",
    "en": "In class I do my best in every way.",
    "image": "books/0095/11.jpg"
   },
   {
    "nl": "Elke dag doe ik al deze goede dingen. Maar wat ik het fijnste vind, is spelen en spelen!",
    "en": "I do all these good things every day. But the thing I like most, is to play and play!",
    "image": "books/0095/12.jpg"
   }
  ],
  "avi": "AVI M4",
  "shelf": "eerste",
  "colour": "#3bb8a0"
 }
]